# DS5005: wrong forms. Each property is checked on its own.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render timechart with (title = 1, xtitle = Month, ymin = "0", legend = hiden)
---- expected
error[DS5005]: `title` must be a constant string
  --> query:2:34
  |
2 | | render timechart with (title = 1, xtitle = Month, ymin = "0", legend = hiden)
  |                                  ^ this is not a constant string
  |
  = help: write a string literal such as `title = "Revenue"`, or the name of a `let` bound to one

error[DS5005]: `xtitle` must be a constant string
  --> query:2:46
  |
2 | | render timechart with (title = 1, xtitle = Month, ymin = "0", legend = hiden)
  |                                              ^^^^^ this is not a constant string
  |
  = help: write the text in quotes: `xtitle = "Month"`

error[DS5005]: `ymin` must be a constant number
  --> query:2:60
  |
2 | | render timechart with (title = 1, xtitle = Month, ymin = "0", legend = hiden)
  |                                                            ^^^ this is not a constant number
  |
  = help: write a number such as `ymin = 0`, or the name of a `let` bound to one

error[DS5005]: unknown `legend` value `hiden`
  --> query:2:74
  |
2 | | render timechart with (title = 1, xtitle = Month, ymin = "0", legend = hiden)
  |                                                                          ^^^^^ expected `visible` or `hidden`
  |
  = help: a value with a similar name exists: `hidden`
